    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "C. 76 M²  2 BEDROOM & 1 BATHROOM MID TERRACE HOME SET IN CENTRAL LOCATION JUST A SHORT WALK FROM ARKLOW’S  MAIN STREET.   WITH ON STREET PARKING, DOUBLE GLAZING, ELECTRIC HEATING, SOLID FUEL STOVE, ENCLOSED REAR GARDEN & GARDEN SHED.  SET IN A LOVELY LOCATION CLOSE TO ARKLOW HARBOUR, ARKLOW GOLF CLUB AND THE SOUTH BEACH."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL  (1.12M X 1.79M)\r\nWith tiled flooring, and coat rack.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM  (4.76M X 4.09M + 1.69M X 2.77M)\r\nLocated to the front with laminate flooring, cast iron fireplace housing a solid fuel stove, open under stairs storage\r\nand carpeted stairs to first floor.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM  (4.33M X 4.31M)\r\nGood sized room located to the rear of the property with fully fitted shaker style kitchen.  Incorporating extractor fan\r\nand Belling cooker.  Under counter Hoover washing machine.  Tiled floor, tiled splash backs, walk in storage unit and\r\nlocation of shelved hot press.  Door through to rear garden.  \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nLANDING   \r\nWith carpeted flooring and velux window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1  (4.20M X 2.19M)\r\nLocated to the front with carpeted flooring, original fire place, shelving and tv point.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\t(5.04M X 2.44M)\r\nLocated to the front with carpeted flooring, original fire place and mirrored double door wardrobe.\r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM  (2.20M X 2.43M)\r\nLocated to the rear of the house with white suite wc, whb and built in shower unit (Triton T90sr electric shower).\r\nTiled around shower, lino flooring and mirror over sink.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE \r\nOn street parking available to the front of the property.  Enclosed paved rear garden, with a mix of stone & block wall boundaries with timber privacy fencing on top.  Garden Shed (4.00M X 1.40M), block with flat roof. \r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nServices – Electricity, Water, Sewerage – general mains supply.\r\nHeating –  Electric Heating and Solid Fuel Stove in Sitting Room.  New electric heating system installed in 2023.\r\nExternal Windows & Doors – uPVC double glazed windows & back door, composite front door.  New back windows, \r\nback door and front door installed in 2022.\r\nBER – G  (Number: 108223710)\r\n\t\t\t \r\nGENERAL\r\nNo. 15 Harbour Road offers bright and homely accommodation and comes onto the market in good condition throughout.  The Harbour Road is centrally located and is set a short walk from Arklow’s Main Street where a host of amenities, facilities bus & rail links are available.  The property is a short stroll  to The Harbour, Arklow Golf Club, the South Beach and a small supermarket & deli is located close by.  This is a  lovely home of character and charm, it would make an ideal starter home or a home for those wishing to downsize. Viewing is strongly recommended."
      },
